        "statement": "\u0027Oldest first\u0027 means the order of the Library.Fines list. Loans.returnCopy appends each new fine to the end of that list, so the list is already in assessment order. It is not re-sorted by AssessedOn: the list order also settles fines assessed on the same day. The payment is spread across fines with List.mapFold when it is made, and each fine takes min(remaining, unpaid) before the next fine gets anything.",
